# TypePHP

- Compile as a PHP **extension** (`mode: ext` in `project.yml`). No `main()`.
- Build only in Docker via `eloquage-typephp-builder` (harness `docker/typephp/build-package.sh` or `docker run -v "$PWD":/src`).
- Copy `project.yml.example` to `project.yml` (gitignored). Do not commit generated YAML or `build/`.
- No free-floating top-level executable statements. TypePHP is always strict types.
- Check https://github.com/swoole/typephp/blob/master/docs/en/INCOMPATIBLE_PHP_FEATURES.md before using dynamic PHP.
- Public API stays in `src/`. `native/` is optional acceleration.
- Never require TypePHP for Composer consumers. Pure-PHP fallback is mandatory.
